Kali Danube

Kali Danube (pocapan jroning &lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;basa Inggris&lt;/a&gt;) iku &lt;a href="kali"&gt;kali&lt;/a&gt; paling dawa nomer loro ing &lt;a href="Uni%20%C3%89ropa"&gt;Uni Éropa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Éropa&lt;/a&gt; sawisé &lt;a href="Kali%20Volga"&gt;Kali Volga&lt;/a&gt;.
Kali iki asalé saka &lt;a href="Alas%20Ireng"&gt;Alas Ireng&lt;/a&gt; (Black Forest) ing &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; saka kali-kali cilik &lt;a href="Kali%20Brigach"&gt;Brigach&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kali%20Breg"&gt;Breg&lt;/a&gt; sing nggabung ing kutha &lt;a href="Donaueschingen"&gt;Donaueschingen&lt;/a&gt;, sawisé iku banjur diarani Danube lan mili mangétan watara 2850&amp;nbsp;km (1771 miles), ngliwati papat kutha krajan Éropa Tengah lan Éropa Wétan, sadurungé lumebu &lt;a href="Sagara%20Ireng"&gt;Sagara Ireng&lt;/a&gt; liwat &lt;a href="Delta%20Danube"&gt;Delta Danube&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Romania"&gt;Romania&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ukraina"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt;.
Misuwur ing sajarah minangka tapel wates &lt;a href="Kakaisaran%20Roma"&gt;Kakaisaran Roma&lt;/a&gt;, kali iki mili—utawa dadi wates antara—sepuluh Nagara: &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; (7.5%), &lt;a href="Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt; (10.3%), &lt;a href="Slowak"&gt;Slowak&lt;/a&gt; (5.8%), &lt;a href="Hungaria"&gt;Hungaria&lt;/a&gt; (11.7%), &lt;a href="Kroasia"&gt;Kroasia&lt;/a&gt; (4.5%), &lt;a href="Serbia"&gt;Serbia&lt;/a&gt; (10.3%), &lt;a href="Romania"&gt;Romania&lt;/a&gt; (28.9%), &lt;a href="Bulgaria"&gt;Bulgaria&lt;/a&gt; (5.2%), &lt;a href="Moldova"&gt;Moldova&lt;/a&gt; (1.7%), lan &lt;a href="Ukraina"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt; (3.8%).
