<doc id="44202" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=44202" title="Commelinales">
Commelinales

Commelinales iku salah siji &lt;a href="Ordo%20%28biologi%29"&gt;bangsa&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="tetuwuhan%20ngembang"&gt;tetuwuhan ngembang&lt;/a&gt; sing kalebu sajeroning &lt;a href="klad"&gt;klad&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="commelinids"&gt;commelinids&lt;/a&gt; (”core monocots”), &lt;a href="monocots"&gt;monocots&lt;/a&gt; miturut &lt;a href="Sistem%20klasifikasi%20APG%20II"&gt;Sistem klasifikasi APG II&lt;/a&gt;). Bangsa iki uga diakoni minangka &lt;a href="takson"&gt;takson&lt;/a&gt; sajeroning &lt;a href="sistem%20klasifikasi%20Cronquist"&gt;sistem klasifikasi Cronquist&lt;/a&gt; lan kacakup sajeroning &lt;a href="kelas%20%28biologi%29"&gt;anak kelas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Commelinidae"&gt;Commelinidae&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kelas%20%28biologi%29"&gt;kelas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Liliopsida"&gt;Liliopsida&lt;/a&gt;.
Ana limang &lt;a href="familia"&gt;suku&lt;/a&gt; tetuwuhan sing kagabung ing jeroné miturut sistem APG II:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Commelinaceae"&gt;Commelinaceae&lt;/a&gt; (kanthi watara 650 spésies)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Haemodoraceae"&gt;Haemodoraceae&lt;/a&gt; (kanthi watara 75 spésies)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Hanguanaceae"&gt;Hanguanaceae&lt;/a&gt; (rong jinis saka Asia tropis)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Philydraceae"&gt;Philydraceae&lt;/a&gt; (limang jinis saka Asia tropis)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Pontederiaceae"&gt;Pontederiaceae&lt;/a&gt; (kanthi watara telung lusin jinis anggota sing urip ing perairan, kalebu &lt;a href="eceng%20gondhok"&gt;eceng gondhok&lt;/a&gt;).</li>
</ul>
Sajeroning &lt;a href="Sistem%20Cronquist"&gt;Sistem Cronquist&lt;/a&gt; Commelinales anggotané Commelinaceae lan telung suku sing sajeroning sistem APG II dilebokaké sajeroning &lt;a href="Zingiberales"&gt;Zingiberales&lt;/a&gt;.
