<li>&lt;a href="Jawa"&gt;Jawa&lt;/a&gt; lan saubengé: 2</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Kalimantan"&gt;Kalimantan&lt;/a&gt; lan saubengé: 3</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Sulawesi"&gt;Sulawesi&lt;/a&gt; lan saubengé: 4</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Bali"&gt;Bali&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nusa%20Tenggara"&gt;Nusa Tenggara&lt;/a&gt;, lan saubengé: 5</<li>
